{"base_rate":0.3981762917933131,"brier":0.16517249240121581,"bss":0.31072419808774765,"bss_hi":0.4132997763284254,"bss_lo":0.20233690818913247,"chart":{"base":[578.3,60.3],"fp":[174.5,270.6],"lead":"62,226.6 272,191.9 482,169.5 692,156.3","note":{"base":"skill 0.31 — higher than 56% of cities","fp":"low end -2pp, high end +22pp","lead":"day-1 error 1.3 °C — better than 23% of cities","rel":"promised 0% → rained 0%; promised 96% → rained 76%"},"rel":"63.9,466 184.6,430.3 457.5,318.7 668.1,136.4"},"country":"VN","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.16244680851063828,"ess":275.60140938723276,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Hanoi</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Hanoi rain forecast is moderately skilful, though 5 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (99%), believe about\n<b>83%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>0%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 658 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-03-26. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 10.1 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.31, ranked 93 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(52&ndash;147) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>0%</b></td><td class='num'>123</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>10%</td><td class='num'><b>6%</b></td><td class='num'>71</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>31%</td><td class='num'><b>11%</b></td><td class='num'>62</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>53%</td><td class='num'><b>28%</b></td><td class='num'>67</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>72%</td><td class='num'><b>40%</b></td><td class='num'>65</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>88%</td><td class='num'><b>56%</b></td><td class='num'>68</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>99%</td><td class='num'><b>83%</b></td><td class='num'>202</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">5 of 7 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Hanoi</b> <span class=\"muted\">Vietnam</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">5 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.31</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>52&ndash;147\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>658 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Hanoi &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Hanoi\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=